}\\n    74\\t}\\ndocs/prd/README.md:14:| 05-extraction-standard-corrections.md | Dated corrections to the frozen standard page: the statements later decisions changed, read with the page and never merged into it | Three records, 2026-11-05 (D368) |\\ndocs/research/2026-11-14-use-acceptance/DECISION-PAGE-2026-11-16.md:27:- 3 sheets of facts that never reached an answer.\\ndocs/research/2026-11-14-use-acceptance/DECISION-PAGE-2026-11-16.md:124:  proven at no cost on test databases. Nothing runs live, and the one exception to the working rule \\\"never open a live run's\\ndocs/research/2026-11-14-use-acceptance/DECISION-PAGE-2026-11-16.md:261:whole finished day, never part of one.\\ndocs/research/2026-11-14-use-acceptance/DECISION-PAGE-2026-11-16.md:265:1. **How live data is read.** Today's working rule never opens a running database directly, only a copy (AGENTS §9). The product's\\ndocs/research/2026-11-14-use-acceptance/DECISION-PAGE-2026-11-16.md:278:- **A company's formal decision that a dated event will not happen by its date** rules the event out. Example: \\\"NVIDIA will not ship\\ndocs/research/2026-11-01-e2e-loop/log.md:35:| 9 | 2026-11-02 | **判断的尺子（D3）建了草稿，不发臂**：`judgement-gold/ruler-v1.md`（定义）、`reader-brief.md`、`packet-v1.json`（golden-v5 的 309 条事项，按 sha 引用）、`questions-v1.json`（22 道种子 + 俄亥俄担保，28 条 must_open 映射进去）、读者 A Codex / B Claude、`reconcile.py`、`score_judgement.py`、`corrections-v1.json` | Alex：\\\"你已经改了好几次尺子了，到底什么是对的，以及你怎么 freeze\\\"；随后 \\\"做完的 review 过的尺子金标不能再动了\\\"（D261，写进 AGE\\ndocs/research/2026-11-01-e2e-loop/log.md:53:| 26 | 2026-11-02 22:10 | v74i / poc-v108：v74h 的复核三句例外收窄回标准原话（Alex：\\\"收窄那三句，直接测\\\"） | 核心 v74d 59 → 70、辅助 87 → 117、杂音 89 → 81（扣长引文 56 → 54），核心三次全没到 3 → 0 | `proof-v108-*` | 候选；设不设默认 Alex 定 |\\ndocs/research/2026-11-01-e2e-loop/design-v78-fields.md:364:**Alex（22:15）：\\\"那致癌案（债务兜底那篇）的核心事实不就退步了\\\"**：兜底那篇（2.6 万字，T8）三次发送写出的条数差很多（v74i [17, 6, 16]，v74h [13, 4, 7]，v74g [9, 3, 8]），写得少的那几次只记中段的兜底计划、跳过开头的市场判断（核心）和后面的预测；核心\\\"市场估计仍明显偏低\\\"的有无跟